course: dictionary
lesson: 14215
title: Words for where we live
level: primary-5
stars: 2
explain: A municipality is a town, city or district that runs its own local services. «The municipality collects our rubbish bins every Monday.» The clues are bins and collects: something is looking after the town's services.
explain: «The municipality built a new library next to the park.» Libraries and parks are local services, so a municipality is the group in charge of them. Check by swapping in your meaning: «The town built a new library next to the park» still makes sense.
explain: «Each municipality has a council, and the council makes local decisions.» Here the clue is council, so the word can also mean the local government itself. Both meanings go together: the place and the people who run it.
fact: A municipality is a town, city or district with its own local government.
fact: The local government of a municipality is called the council.
fact: Municipalities usually run local services such as bins, parks, libraries and water.
fact: «Municipality» is a common word in Canada, Ireland and Australia.
fact: «Municipality» is a formal word, so you will meet it more often in writing than in everyday talk.
exercise: «The municipality collects our rubbish bins every Monday.» What does municipality mean here? | A park with a pond | A type of rubbish bin | *A town or district with its own local government | A bus that goes to the city
exercise: «Each municipality has a council that makes local decisions.» What is the council in this sentence? | A type of bin | *The local government of the town | A river that runs through the town | A sort of library
exercise: Which local service is named in «The municipality built a new library next to the park.»? | A harbour | A hospital | A railway | *A library
test: Which of these is a service a municipality usually runs? | *Bin collection | Mountains | Stars | Clouds
test: Which country is a common place to hear the word municipality? | *Canada | The Moon | The Sahara Desert | Atlantis
exam: What is a municipality? | A park for picnics | A kind of bus | A type of rubbish bin | *A town or city with its own local government
